{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46244","headline":"将入匡山宿韩判官宅 · 贯休","name":"将入匡山宿韩判官宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一宿兰堂接上才，白云归去几裴回。\n黛青峯朵孤吟後，雪白猨儿必寄来。\n帘卷茶烟萦堕叶，月明棊子落深苔。\n明朝江上空回首，始觉清风不可陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}